---
// terms.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service – Toolivo"
  description="Read the terms and conditions governing the use of Toolivo free online image and PDF utility platform."
  canonicalPath="/terms/"
>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 2.5rem; padding-bottom: 5rem;">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Terms of Service' }]} />

    <article style="max-width: 820px; margin: 2rem auto;">
      <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
        <span class="badge badge-primary" style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Legal Terms</span>
        <h1 style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem;">Last updated: October 1, 2026</p>
      </header>

      <div class="blog-content" style="font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-secondary);">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using Toolivo ("the Website"), you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please discontinue using the service.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Permitted Use</h2>
        <p>
          Toolivo provides free, client-side online tools for personal and commercial file transformation, compression, and analysis. You agree to use the service in compliance with all applicable local, national, and international laws.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
        <p>
          You retain full ownership and copyright of all files, images, documents, and texts that you process through Toolivo. Toolivo claims zero ownership or intellectual property rights over any user content.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Disclaimer of Warranty</h2>
        <p>
          The tools and resources on this Website are provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied. Toolivo does not guarantee that file transformations will be error-free or uninterrupted. Users are encouraged to maintain backup copies of their important files.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Modifications</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of Toolivo after such updates constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms of Service.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
